[00:15.24]Raise your eyes up and see,
[00:18.74]Far above the highest hill.
[00:23.38]There stands Jehovah’s mountain
[00:27.56]Lifted up in this day.
[00:32.61]People come from afar,
[00:37.60]Ev’rywhere from sea to sea,
[00:41.55]Calling to one another,
[00:45.86]‘Come serve God and obey.’
[00:49.86]Now the time has arrived
[00:53.24]For the small, a great nation to be.
[00:58.98]As we grow and we thrive,
[01:03.52]God’s direction and blessing we see.
[01:07.98]Millions now come to God
[01:12.72]And accept his sov’reignty.
[01:17.82]Loyal they vow to be
[01:21.70]And from his side never stray.
[01:26.78]Jesus gave the command
[01:28.64]To go forth and preach the word.
[01:55.40]Good news about the Kingdom
[01:59.30]Reaches all men today.
[02:04.64]Christ now rules from above,
[02:08.92]Urging all to take his side.
[02:13.90]Meek ones who hear his voice
[02:17.80]Let God’s Word show them the way.
[02:22.62]It brings joy to the heart,
[02:27.24]As the great crowd continues to grow.
[02:32.02]And we all have a part,
[02:36.62]As we strive to let ev’ryone know.
[02:41.90]Let us lift up the voice,
[02:46.30]Calling out for all to hear,
[02:51.14]‘Come to Jehovah’s mountain,
[02:56.22]Here forever to stay.’
